cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its audit code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Mailroom Dataset v1: An Evaluation and Ingress Simulation Corpus for Legal Document Triage"
abstract: >-
  3,302 legal and insurance documents in five classes and 55 strata, assembled
  from public sources (CUAD, MAUD, SEC EDGAR, Enron email and insurance
  sources) with stable identity, per-label provenance and a blind
  configuration that carries no labels. This repository audits the published
  dataset and holds the helpers that build and publish revisions. Licensing
  varies by component: the aggregate dataset card declares CC BY 4.0, while the
  Enron correspondence rows keep research-use terms and must not be
  redistributed outside research contexts or used in production or consumer
  applications. See the dataset card for the terms of each source.
authors:
  - family-names: Burleson
    given-names: Jack J.
version: v9.2
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Exios66/Mailroom-Corpus-EDA"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Lucius-Morningstar/mailroom-dataset"
keywords:
  - document classification
  - legal NLP
  - data engineering
  - dataset audit
  - provenance
